{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>RPG Stories VTT | Unlock Players' Seats</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This special DLC for RPG Stories VTT enhances the multiplayer experience by allowing you to <strong>invite players using the Free Demo to your online sessions</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you're a professional GM or want the flexibility to invite different players each time without them needing to pay, then this DLC is for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although owners of the original RPG Stories VTT GM Version can already host games and invite players using the  GM Version, the <strong>Unlock Player Seats DLC allows you to invite up to 10 players to your online sessions\u2014unlimited times and with different players each time.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The key difference is that these 10 players don\u2019t need to pay to play; they only need to download the\u00a0<i>Free RPG Stories Demo via Steam.</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Easy to Host &amp; Stable Multiplayer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727010/extras/Unlock_Player_Seats_DLC.gif?t=1741863380\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2727010?t=1741863380","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727010/cfe7beaaeaa1d1ab9076ece75b417ee574fbed1f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741863380","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727010/f1667249a78d4cfb9fd247f84a47795b02fd64f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741863380","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2727010/f1667249a78d4cfb9fd247f84a47795b02fd64f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741863380","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-o